			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732171201,
					"content": "本会经营璃月生产的宝石制品和名贵矿石，与多家船队皆有长期合作，货源充足，渠道稳定。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732171202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732171202,
					"content": "另有少量时新丝绸及时装出售，欲购从速。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732171203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732171203,
					"content": "须弥本地毛毯、草药、宝石首饰、织锦制品等优质商品如有好渠道，亦请友商尽管前来洽谈，以交良缘。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7321713,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7321713
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7321713",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7321713,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732171301,
					"content": "「有人相信吗？我上个月出海到了一个国家，他们的国王连马都没见过。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732171302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732171302,
					"content": "「所以我决定贩一批驮兽去，然后告诉他们这就是马，哈哈。要是这单做成了，我说不定也能混成个国王什么的当当呢！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732171303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732171303,
					"content": "「国王是什么？」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732171304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732171304,
					"content": "「就是一种和港务官或者维齐尔差不多，但是比他们官威更大的大官，就像传说中的二十九代伊那样…哎呀太难跟你形容了。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732171305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				},
				{
					"id": 732171305,
					"content": "「一看就是你编的吧。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "公告板"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7321714,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7321714
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
